# Built binary from the README's `go build -o typeburn ./cmd/typeburn`.
# Anchored: a bare `typeburn` matches any path component of that name at any
# depth, which silently excluded new files under cmd/typeburn/ from `git add .`.
# (`make build` writes to ./bin/, ignored above.)
/typeburn

